    <!-- =========================================================== HERO -->
    <section class="pmc-hero pmc-hero--about" aria-label="About us hero">
      <div class="pmc-container">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <ol class="pmc-breadcrumb">
            <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">About us</a></li>
            <li><span aria-current="page">Our Purpose &amp; Values</span></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <div class="pmc-hero__inner">
          <figure class="pmc-hero__media">
            <img src="/images/about-hero.jpg" alt="Sea link bridge over the water at dusk" loading="eager">
          </figure>
          <div class="pmc-hero__content">
            <h1 class="pmc-hero__title">To enable positive change and real impact</h1>
            <p class="pmc-hero__text">We believe India's journey to becoming a developed nation by 2047 will be shaped by stronger institutions, better governance, and empowered communities. Every engagement, every system we build, and every official we train contributes to that vision. For us, Viksit Bharat is not a tagline, it is our purpose. We hold ourselves to a simple standard: be genuinely useful, act with integrity, and focus on outcomes over activity. As trusted partners to government, we stay curious, agile, and committed until meaningful change is achieved.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

