    <!-- ===================================================== FRAMEWORK -->
    <section class="pmc-split pmc-split--reverse pmc-split--framework" aria-label="Why choose PMC">
      <div class="pmc-container">
        <div class="pmc-split__inner">
          <figure class="pmc-split__media">
            <img src="/images/about-framework.jpg" alt="A compass symbolising direction and trust">
          </figure>
          <div class="pmc-split__content">
            <h2 class="pmc-heading">Experience You Can Trust. Commitment You Can Count On.</h2>
            <p class="pmc-subheading">We bring decades of experience across governance, public policy, technology, and programme delivery, with deep roots in the sectors and states where we work. We've been in the room, on the ground, and inside the complexity of India's toughest public programmes. What sets us apart is conviction. PMC was built on the belief that India's development story deserves better solutions, honest partnerships, and consultants who stay accountable to outcomes. We are Indian, embedded in this story, and committed to seeing it through.</p>
            <a class="pmc-btn pmc-btn--outline pmc-split__cta" href="#">
              Meet our leadership
